WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
But if the window over there can't be opened or it's poisonous inside,

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,720
Come and help, Li Hao, hold the box steady.

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,640
Connect those straps and ropes

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:18,110
Check if it's firm. I'll go out first and remember.

5
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,230
Your second stroke sticks to the wall

6
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:23,390
Move your center of gravity a little bit and don't look down to the pipe.

7
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:24,870
Hold on tight to stabilize the bracket

8
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:26,670
Go over to the window sill next door, do you understand?

9
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:29,110
I'll fix the rope when I get there

10
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:35,920
You hold on to the rope and move. If you miss, at least you can hold on to the rope.

11
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,520
Li Huian, it’s your turn

12
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:45,810
Slow down. Don't panic. Hurry up.

13
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:50,800
Step on that tripod firmly and then climb over to the next window sill, be careful.
